  "A Splendid Gift": "",
  "Hey, it's Bakumatsu Bob Utsunomiya I wasn't feeling the first name thing, forget about it. Anyway, come get your seventh heavenly gift. The Shippu & Filling Cooking Pack, waiting for you in the kitchen of Teradaya.": "",
  "Greetings, this is Bakumatsu Bob Utsunomiya. I heard you apprehended all the Wanted Men. Daunting. I have a reward for you. Meet me in the kitchen at Teradaya and I'll give it to you.": "",
  "Greetings, this is Bakumatsu Bob Utsunomiya. I heard you completed Another Life. That's nice. I have a reward for you. Meet me in the kitchen at Teradaya and I'll give it to you.": "",
  "Greetings, this is Bakumatsu Bob Utsunomiya. I heard you completed all the Dungeons. You could probably use a bath. I have a reward for you. Meet me in the kitchen at Teradaya and I'll give it to you.": "",
  "Greetings, this is Bakumatsu Bob Utsunomiya. I heard you completed all the Minigames. That must have been fun. I have a reward for you. Meet me in the kitchen at Teradaya and I'll give it to you.": "",
  "Greetings, this is Bakumatsu Bob Utsunomiya. I heard you completed all your Masters' training. How adequate. I have a reward for you. Meet me in the kitchen at Teradaya and I'll give it to you.": "",
  "Greetings, this is Bakumatsu Bob Utsunomiya. I heard you completed Equipment Smithing. Well smelted. I have a reward for you. Meet me in the kitchen at Teradaya and I'll give it to you.": "",
  "Greetings, this is Bakumatsu Bob Utsunomiya. I heard you completed all the Ultimate Challenges. Did you enjoy them? I have a reward for you. Meet me in the kitchen at Teradaya and I'll give it to you.": "",
  "Greetings, this is Bakumatsu Bob Utsunomiya. I heard you completed the Arena. So violent. I have a reward for you. Meet me in the kitchen at Teradaya and I'll give it to you.": "",
  "Greetings, this is Bakumatsu Bob Utsunomiya. I heard you completed all the Meals. Tasty. I have a reward for you. Meet me in the kitchen at Teradaya and I'll give it to you.": "",
  "Greetings, my name is Bakumatsu Bob Utsunomiya. I'm going to give you some useful things, and I'm going to do it eight times. Consider them gifts from the heavens, okay? The first of these is the Chiyoganemaru and Bakumatsu Assistance Pack. I'll be waiting in the kitchen of Teradaya to bequeath it to you.": "",
  "Greetings, this is Bakumatsu Bob Utsunomiya. I heard you completed all the Substories. Good for you. I have a reward for you. Meet me in the kitchen at Teradaya and I'll give it to you.": "",
  "Greetings, this is Bakumatsu Bob Utsunomiya. I heard you completed the Heat Actions. Okay. I have a reward for you. Meet me in the kitchen at Teradaya and I'll give it to you.": "",
  "Hey. I got your fourth gift from the heavens. This time it's Kijin-maru Kunishige and Fresh Fish Pack. I'll give it to you in the kitchen of Teradaya. Oh, this is Bakumatsu Bob Utsunomiya. I forgot to write that up top.": "",
  "Hello again. For what may be the last time, it's Bakumatsu Bob Utsunomiya. I have your final gift from the heavens, the Kurofune Taiho & Practical Troops Pack. I'm at the kitchen of Teradaya, don't be a stranger.": "",
  "It's Bakumatsu Bob—we're on first name terms by now, I think. Anyway, sixth heavenly gift coming your way. It's the Skink Lizard & Practical Enhancing Materials Pack. Teradaya's kitchen sound good?": "",
  "Bakumatsu Bob Utsunomiya here. Listen up. I got your third gift from the heavens. This time it's the Selected Equipment Pack. I'll give it to you in the kitchen of Teradaya. See you.": "",
  "It's Bakumatsu Bob Utsunomiya. Miss me? I got your fifth gift from the heavens. It's the Amulet of the Gods and Growth Assistance Pack. Come to the kitchen of Teradaya for it. You know the drill.": "",
  "Kept you waiting, huh? It's Bakumatsu Bob Utsunomiya. I got your second gift from the heavens. This time it's the Armor Breaker and Fresh Veggies Pack. I'll give it to you in the kitchen of Teradaya, so... hurry up and get over here.": "",
  "Saito-san, your final payment is due. Bring 20 ryo to the shrine, like always. Man... I'm actually going to miss this. Seeing you, and you giving me money... Oh well, all good things, right?": "",
  "Saito-san, it's time. Sorry, did that sound ominous? Well... Debt is a serious matter! Just bring 20 ryo to the shrine in northeast Fushimi, all right? I'll be waiting there.": "",
  "Saito-san, your third payment is due. I'll be waiting at the Fushimi shrine, like last time. It's 20 ryo—also, could you pick me up a bento on the way? Actually, forget it, I'll get it myself, you don't know what I like.": "",
  "Saito-san, your second payment is due. I'll be waiting at the Fushimi shrine, like last time. It's 20 ryo, and don't try to tell me the place has problems like my other tenants. I'm not a handyman!": "",
  "Saito-san, your fourth payment is due. It's 20 ryo, and don't worry about coming to the shrine, I'm actually standing right behind you! Haha, did you look? Just kidding—wouldn't that have been funny? Seriously, though, come and pay me.": "",
  "I bestow upon you the demonic sword, Hoekurenai. May it lead you to bloodthirsty victory in your battles. The surly man in white face paint awaits you in the kitchen of Teradaya, so that you might inherit its glory... and its curse.": "",
  "This is Inamoto, the Black Panther Couriers' playmaker. If your feet are rested and prepared, let's have our match. I'll await you at the bridge near the gambling den in Rakugai. Once and for all, we'll see who's fastest in Kyo.": "",
