  "Greetings, this is Bakumatsu Bob Utsunomiya. I heard you completed all the Ultimate Challenges. Did you enjoy them? I have a reward for you. Meet me in the kitchen at Teradaya and I'll give it to you.": "おう、宇都宮という者だ。\nあんた、究極闘技を\n全て制覇したそうじゃないか。\n本当に、大したもんだぜ。\n\nそんなあんたに、ごほうびだ。\n寺田屋でくれてやるから\nさっさと台所まで来い。",
  "Greetings, this is Bakumatsu Bob Utsunomiya. I heard you completed the Arena. So violent. I have a reward for you. Meet me in the kitchen at Teradaya and I'll give it to you.": "おう、宇都宮という者だ。\nあんた、闘技場を\n全て制覇したそうじゃないか。\n本当に、大したもんだぜ。\n\nそんなあんたに、ごほうびだ。\n寺田屋でくれてやるから\nさっさと台所まで来い。",
  "Greetings, this is Bakumatsu Bob Utsunomiya. I heard you completed all the Meals. Tasty. I have a reward for you. Meet me in the kitchen at Teradaya and I'll give it to you.": "おう、宇都宮という者だ。\nあんた、食事を\n全て制覇したそうじゃないか。\n本当に、大したもんだぜ。\n\nそんなあんたに、ごほうびだ。\n寺田屋でくれてやるから\nさっさと台所まで来い。",
  "Greetings, my name is Bakumatsu Bob Utsunomiya. I'm going to give you some useful things, and I'm going to do it eight times. Consider them gifts from the heavens, okay? The first of these is the Chiyoganemaru and Bakumatsu Assistance Pack. I'll be waiting in the kitchen of Teradaya to bequeath it to you.": "おう、宇都宮という者だ。\nこれから八回にわたって\nお前にお得な物をくれてやる。\n天からのごほうびだと思え。\n早速第一弾をさずかった。\n今回は\n気刀　千代金丸と\n幕末お役立ちパックだ。\n寺田屋でくれてやるから\nさっさと台所まで来い。",
  "Greetings, this is Bakumatsu Bob Utsunomiya. I heard you completed all the Substories. Good for you. I have a reward for you. Meet me in the kitchen at Teradaya and I'll give it to you.": "おう、宇都宮という者だ。\nサブストーリーを\n全て制覇したそうじゃないか。\n本当に、大したもんだぜ。\n\nそんなあんたに、ごほうびだ。\n寺田屋でくれてやるから\nさっさと台所まで来い。",
  "Greetings, this is Bakumatsu Bob Utsunomiya. I heard you completed the Heat Actions. Okay. I have a reward for you. Meet me in the kitchen at Teradaya and I'll give it to you.": "おう、宇都宮という者だ。\nヒートアクションを\n全て制覇したそうじゃないか。\n本当に、大したもんだぜ。\n\nそんなあんたに、ごほうびだ。\n寺田屋でくれてやるから\nさっさと台所まで来い。",
  "Hey. I got your fourth gift from the heavens. This time it's Kijin-maru Kunishige and Fresh Fish Pack. I'll give it to you in the kitchen of Teradaya. Oh, this is Bakumatsu Bob Utsunomiya. I forgot to write that up top.": "よう、宇都宮だ。\n天からのごほうびの\n第四弾をさずかったぞ。\n今回は\n銘刀　鬼神丸国重と\nぴちぴち鮮魚パックだ。\n寺田屋でくれてやるから\nさっさと台所まで来い。",
  "Hello again. For what may be the last time, it's Bakumatsu Bob Utsunomiya. I have your final gift from the heavens, the Kurofune Taiho & Practical Troops Pack. I'm at the kitchen of Teradaya, don't be a stranger.": "宇都宮だ。\n天からのごほうびも\nついに最後になったな。\n今回は\n黒船大砲と\n実用隊士パックだ。\n寺田屋でくれてやるから\nさっさと台所まで来い。",
  "It's Bakumatsu Bob—we're on first name terms by now, I think. Anyway, sixth heavenly gift coming your way. It's the Skink Lizard & Practical Enhancing Materials Pack. Teradaya's kitchen sound good?": "宇都宮だ。いい知らせだ。\n天からのごほうびの\n第六弾をさずかったぞ。\n今回は\n妖刀　蜥蜴丸と\n実用錬成素材パックだ。\n寺田屋でくれてやるから\nさっさと台所まで来い。",
  "Bakumatsu Bob Utsunomiya here. Listen up. I got your third gift from the heavens. This time it's the Selected Equipment Pack. I'll give it to you in the kitchen of Teradaya. See you.": "宇都宮だ。おい、良くきけ。\n天からのごほうびの\n第三弾をさずかったぞ。\n今回は\n選りすぐり装備品パックだ。\n寺田屋でくれてやるから\nさっさと台所まで来い。",
  "It's Bakumatsu Bob Utsunomiya. Miss me? I got your fifth gift from the heavens. It's the Amulet of the Gods and Growth Assistance Pack. Come to the kitchen of Teradaya for it. You know the drill.": "宇都宮だ。待ちかねたか。\n天からのごほうびの\n第五弾をさずかったぞ。\n今回は\n御神護符と\n成長お助けパックだ。\n寺田屋でくれてやるから\nさっさと台所まで来い。",
  "Kept you waiting, huh? It's Bakumatsu Bob Utsunomiya. I got your second gift from the heavens. This time it's the Armor Breaker and Fresh Veggies Pack. I'll give it to you in the kitchen of Teradaya, so... hurry up and get over here.": "待たせたな、宇都宮だ。\n天からのごほうびの\n第二弾をさずかったぞ。\n今回は\n剛銃\nＡｒｍｏｒ ｂｒｅａｋｅｒ\nと新鮮お野菜パックだ。\n寺田屋でくれてやるから\nさっさと台所まで来い。",
  "Saito-san, your final payment is due. Bring 20 ryo to the shrine, like always. Man... I'm actually going to miss this. Seeing you, and you giving me money... Oh well, all good things, right?": "斎藤殿\nいよいよ最後の返済期日だ。\n二十両を持って、\n伏見の北東にある\nいつもの神社の前に来てくれ。\nわしはそこで待っている。\nよろしく頼むぞ。",
  "Saito-san, it's time. Sorry, did that sound ominous? Well... Debt is a serious matter! Just bring 20 ryo to the shrine in northeast Fushimi, all right? I'll be waiting there.": "斎藤殿\nそろそろ第一回の返済期日だ。\n二十両を持って、\n伏見の北東にある\n神社の前に来てくれ。\nわしはそこで待っている。\nよろしく頼むぞ。",
  "Saito-san, your third payment is due. I'll be waiting at the Fushimi shrine, like last time. It's 20 ryo—also, could you pick me up a bento on the way? Actually, forget it, I'll get it myself, you don't know what I like.": "斎藤殿\nそろそろ第三回の返済期日だ。\n二十両を持って、\n伏見の北東にある\nいつもの神社の前に来てくれ。\nわしはそこで待っている。\nよろしく頼むぞ。",
  "Saito-san, your second payment is due. I'll be waiting at the Fushimi shrine, like last time. It's 20 ryo, and don't try to tell me the place has problems like my other tenants. I'm not a handyman!": "斎藤殿\nそろそろ第二回の返済期日だ。\n二十両を持って、\n伏見の北東にある\nいつもの神社の前に来てくれ。\nわしはそこで待っている。\nよろしく頼むぞ。",
  "Saito-san, your fourth payment is due. It's 20 ryo, and don't worry about coming to the shrine, I'm actually standing right behind you! Haha, did you look? Just kidding—wouldn't that have been funny? Seriously, though, come and pay me.": "斎藤殿\nそろそろ第四回の返済期日だ。\n二十両を持って、\n伏見の北東にある\nいつもの神社の前に来てくれ。\nわしはそこで待っている。\nよろしく頼むぞ。",
  "I bestow upon you the demonic sword, Hoekurenai. May it lead you to bloodthirsty victory in your battles. The surly man in white face paint awaits you in the kitchen of Teradaya, so that you might inherit its glory... and its curse.": "貴殿へ妖刀「吼紅」を\n贈ろう。\n\nきっと戦いの助けに\nなってくれるはずだ。\n\n寺田屋という宿屋にいる\n白塗りの男から受け取れ。\n台所に居るはずだ。",
  "This is Inamoto, the Black Panther Couriers' playmaker. If your feet are rested and prepared, let's have our match. I'll await you at the bridge near the gambling den in Rakugai. Once and for all, we'll see who's fastest in Kyo.": "黒豹の司令塔こと、\n黒豹飛脚団の稲本だ。\n\n貴様を倒す準備が整った。\n早速、勝負といこう。\n\n洛外の賭場近くの橋で\n待っているから、\n準備を整えて来るといい。\n\n俺はいつまでも待っている。\n京最速の座は貴様には譲らん。\n\n楽しみにしているぞ。\n",
